 <subsection title="Other Exceptions">
  <para unique="1091906" format="xIndent1">Non-EVEX-encoded instruction, see Exceptions Type1.SSE2 in <link unique="1091904" linkend="&lt;c&gt;__sdm_vol2A_ch02.fm#11555: 06_Table: Table 2-8. Type 1 Class Exception Conditions" xrefstyle="Table All - no page-period">Table&#160;2&#8209;18, &#8220;Type 1 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</link></para>
  <para unique="1091910" format="xIndent1">EVEX-encoded instruction, see <link unique="1091908" linkend="&lt;c&gt;__sdm_vol2A_ch02.fm#75930: 06_Table: Table 2-44. Type E1 Class Exception Conditions\x11 " xrefstyle="Table All - no page-period">Table&#160;2&#8209;46, &#8220;Type E1 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</link></para>
